{"parse":{"title":"Swords","pageid":5176,"revid":46822,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Swords</b> are a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">weapon</a> class.\n</p><p>Swords have low knockback and low stamina cost for good damage. Sword damage is not reduced when several enemies or objects are hit by a single attack, unlike most other weapons.\n</p>\n<div role=\"note\" data-nosnippet=\"\" class=\"notice hatnote context-link seealso dablink\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Swords_(Skill)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swords (Skill)\">Swords (Skill)</a></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_swords\">List of swords</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSwords%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Icon\n</th>\n<th>Damage\n</th>\n<th>Stamina (primary)\n</th>\n<th>Stamina (secondary)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">One-handed\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bronze_sword\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bronze sword\">Bronze sword</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/9f/Bronze_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210209165118\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Bronze Sword\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/9f/Bronze_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210209165118\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Bronze Sword.png\" data-image-key=\"Bronze_Sword.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 35/53\n</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Iron_sword\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Iron sword\">Iron sword</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/c7/Iron_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132020\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Iron Sword\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/c7/Iron_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132020\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Iron Sword.png\" data-image-key=\"Iron_Sword.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 55/73\n</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_sword\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Silver sword\">Silver sword</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/99/Silver_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132021\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Silver Sword\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Silver Sword.png\" data-image-key=\"Silver_Sword.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/99/Silver_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132021\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 75/93<br />Spirit: 30/45\n</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Black_metal_sword\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black metal sword\">Black metal sword</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d1/Black_Metal_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132015\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Black Metal Sword\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Black Metal Sword.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Metal_Sword.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d1/Black_Metal_Sword.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132015\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 95/113\n</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mistwalker\" title=\"Mistwalker\">Mistwalker</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d5/Mistwalker.png/revision/latest?cb=20221126192442\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Mistwalker\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Mistwalker.png\" data-image-key=\"Mistwalker.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d5/Mistwalker.png/revision/latest?cb=20221126192442\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 75/75<br />Frost: 40/58<br />Spirit: 0/15\n</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nidh%C3%B6gg\" title=\"Nidhögg\">Nidhögg</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6f/Nidh%C3%B6gg.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423143638\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nidhögg\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Nidhögg.png\" data-image-key=\"Nidh%C3%B6gg.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6f/Nidh%C3%B6gg.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423143638\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 135/153\n</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dyrnwyn\" title=\"Dyrnwyn\">Dyrnwyn</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/4a/Dyrnwyn.png/revision/latest?cb=20240519224851\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dyrnwyn\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dyrnwyn.png\" data-image-key=\"Dyrnwyn.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/4/4a/Dyrnwyn.png/revision/latest?cb=20240519224851\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 145/163<br />Fire: 10\n</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">Two-handed\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Krom\" title=\"Krom\">Krom</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/18/Krom.png/revision/latest?cb=20221126192358\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Krom\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Krom.png\" data-image-key=\"Krom.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/18/Krom.png/revision/latest?cb=20221126192358\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 150/168\n</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>40\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6e/Slayer.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423143929\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Slayer\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Slayer.png\" data-image-key=\"Slayer.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6e/Slayer.png/revision/latest?cb=20240423143929\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Slash: 170/188\n</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>40\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSwords%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Attack type</th>\n<th>Stamina</th>\n<th>Range</th>\n<th>Attack speed\n</th>\n<th>Damage\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stagger\" title=\"Stagger\">Staggering</a>\n</th>\n<th>Knockback</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swords (primary)</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>2.4 m</td>\n<td>2.46 s (0.86 + 0.70 + 0.90)\n</td>\n<td>1x + 1x + 2x\n</td>\n<td>1x\n</td>\n<td>40\n</td>\n<td>Player moves forward 0.66 m with each swing. 90 degree arc. No <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_mechanics#Multitarget_penalty\" title=\"Damage mechanics\">multitarget penalty</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swords (secondary)</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n<td>2.7 m</td>\n<td>1.84 s\n</td>\n<td>3x\n</td>\n<td>1x\n</td>\n<td>40\n</td>\n<td>Player moves forward 0.33 m. 10 degree arc.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Two-handed Swords (primary)\n</td>\n<td>1x\n</td>\n<td>2.6m\n</td>\n<td>3.44 s (0.96 + 0.82 + 1.66)\n</td>\n<td>1x + 1x + 2x\n</td>\n<td>1x\n</td>\n<td>55\n</td>\n<td>90 degree arc. No multitarget penalty.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Two-handed Swords (secondary)\n</td>\n<td>2x\n</td>\n<td>?\n</td>\n<td>2.16 s\n</td>\n<td>3x\n</td>\n<td>1x\n</td>\n<td>55\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSwords%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"bf562cc806947aa12f1f189e231bfc51\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:142px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Swords_Hitbox-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:140px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image l